@SystemUserAttendance_HostAddress = http://localhost:5006

GET {{SystemUserAttendance_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

### Check-in
POST {{SystemUserAttendance_HostAddress}}/api/Attendance/checkin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId" :1
}

### Check-out
POST {{SystemUserAttendance_HostAddress}}/api/Attendance/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": 1
}

### Urlop
POST {{SystemUserAttendance_HostAddress}}/api/LeaveRequest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": 1,
  "dateFrom": "2026-09-01T00:00:00",
  "dateTo": "2026-09-08T00:00:00",
  "reason": "Choroba"
}

### Pobranie urlopów
GET {{SystemUserAttendance_HostAddress}}/api/LeaveRequest/1

### Akceptacja urlopu
PUT {{SystemUserAttendance_HostAddress}}/api/LeaveRequest/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newStatus": 1
}

###Odrzucenie urlopu
PUT {{SystemUserAttendance_HostAddress}}/api/LeaveRequest/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newStatus": 2
}
